  "content": "<p>In <a href=\"http://www.cte.ikeadt.com\">www.cte.ikeadt.com</a>, we've added child rules, to set m2_high and m2gigantic_high:<br /><a href=\"https://eur05.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcontrol.akamai.com%2Fapps%2Fproperty-manager%2F%23%2Fproperty-version%2F6353055%2F1194%2Fedit%3Fgid%3D24515%26rule%3D55760e8a-d665-45fa-98e6-91cbe259465b&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjoakim.hogart%40inter.ikea.com%7C2fe214f1339e4616152808dae36a5695%7Ca33c6ac4a52e45c5af07b972df9bd004%7C0%7C0%7C638072343104542551%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=nxteekdpzkqi8pXSmWmSUBTYkLwKBagl6jZ72icRwio%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://control.akamai.com/apps/property-manager/#/property-version/6353055/1194/edit?gid=24515&amp;rule=55760e8a-d665-45fa-98e6-91cbe259465b</a></p><p>Example URL I used:</p><p><a href=\"https://eur05.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cte.ikeadt.com%2Faddon-app%2Fhomesmart%2F3.57.0%2FEducation_entrycard.jpg%3Ff%3Dm&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjoakim.hogart%40inter.ikea.com%7C2fe214f1339e4616152808dae36a5695%7Ca33c6ac4a52e45c5af07b972df9bd004%7C0%7C0%7C638072343104542551%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=3rGB8UFzqftPPTInzRv5kHnnmPCBVq4oBYVpsWn6P5o%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.cte.ikeadt.com/addon-app/homesmart/3.57.0/Education_entrycard.jpg?f=m</a><br />x-im-file-name: m2_high.1.700.webp_jpeg_png_gif</p><p><a href=\"https://eur05.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cte.ikeadt.com%2Faddon-app%2Fhomesmart%2F3.57.0%2FEducation_entrycard.jpg%3Ff%3Dg&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjoakim.hogart%40inter.ikea.com%7C2fe214f1339e4616152808dae36a5695%7Ca33c6ac4a52e45c5af07b972df9bd004%7C0%7C0%7C638072343104542551%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=1xwnbXRNkQu52g8KYgmpAXk956U%2B8QGaMuGtI3KtYC8%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.cte.ikeadt.com/addon-app/homesmart/3.57.0/Education_entrycard.jpg?f=g</a><br />x-im-file-name: m2gigantic_high.1.2000.webp_jpeg_png_gif</p><p>To get information about the policy used etc, you can add the Piez extension to your Chrome browser.<br /><a href=\"https://eur05.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftechdocs.akamai.com%2Fivm%2Fdocs%2Fvalidate-using-piez&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjoakim.hogart%40inter.ikea.com%7C2fe214f1339e4616152808dae36a5695%7Ca33c6ac4a52e45c5af07b972df9bd004%7C0%7C0%7C638072343104542551%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=EC5ybC%2FCRF6NMOqOOSIphDS7uR7PN3o8PKYR6sWSrl0%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://techdocs.akamai.com/ivm/docs/validate-using-piez</a></p><p>I had to create m2gigantic_high, as this does not exist today. The same needs to be done on <a href=\"http://www.ikea.com\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">http://www.ikea.com</a>  and other policy.</p>",
